'''SOL DAE ROKKER''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event|Metal Slug Defense]] collaboration event. It was added to [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]], and [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

